<section class="process-band">
    <div><span class="sec-lbl">How it works</span><h2 class="serif">From event setup to booking approval</h2></div>
    <ol>
        <li><strong>Create event</strong><span>Add venue, date, category, description, and public event visuals.</span></li>
        <li><strong>Add stalls</strong><span>Set stall number, size, price, zone, tier, status, and map position.</span></li>
        <li><strong>Receive requests</strong><span>Vendors choose a stall and submit a booking request with their note.</span></li>
        <li><strong>Verify deposit</strong><span>Organizer checks the payment reference and marks the payment status.</span></li>
        <li><strong>Confirm booking</strong><span>Approved stalls become booked and competing pending requests are handled.</span></li>
    </ol>
</section>

