<section class="faq-section">
    <div class="section-intro wide">
        <span>Common questions</span>
        <h2 class="serif">Details that make the platform feel ready to use</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-grid">
        <article><h3>Can vendors see stall availability?</h3><p>Yes. Each stall has a live status such as available, pending, booked, or unavailable, and the event detail page shows the stall map and stall cards.</p></article>
        <article><h3>Can organizers upload real event images?</h3><p>Yes. Event creation supports event photos and map images so the listing can match the real venue instead of looking generic.</p></article>
        <article><h3>How are payments handled?</h3><p>The platform records payment references and payment status. It does not process money directly, but it gives organizers a place to verify deposits.</p></article>
        <article><h3>Who can approve bookings?</h3><p>Only organizers can review booking requests for events they own. Vendors can request stalls and update payment references from their dashboard.</p></article>
    </div>
</section>

